Find the battery the mainline rk817 charger driver registers

Utils::Platform::queryBatteryInformation looks for a power_supply whose
name contains "/bat", "qcom-battery" or "axp2202-battery". The mainline
rk817_charger driver (RK3326 handhelds on a mainline kernel: R36S, RG351,
Odroid Go Advance) names its supplies "rk817-battery" and "rk817-charger";
neither matches, so the ES falls back to the charger's "status" -- which
that USB-type supply does not export -- and reports a charging battery at
0 %. Add rk817-battery next to the two other vendor names.

--- a/es-core/src/utils/Platform.cpp
+++ b/es-core/src/utils/Platform.cpp
@@ -481,6 +481,9 @@
 					// Allwinner H700 devices use "axp2202-battery"
 					if ((Utils::String::toLower(file).find("/axp2202-battery") != std::string::npos) && (batteryRootPath.empty()))
 						batteryRootPath = file;
+					// Rockchip RK817 (mainline rk817_charger) devices use "rk817-battery"
+					if ((Utils::String::toLower(file).find("/rk817-battery") != std::string::npos) && (batteryRootPath.empty()))
+						batteryRootPath = file;
 
 					if ((Utils::String::toLower(file).find("fuel") != std::string::npos) && (fuelgaugeRootPath.empty()))
 						fuelgaugeRootPath = file;
